                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "32135dfa-87dc-34a7-991e-147f8fa77eca",
                        "entry_id": "83b20194-e1ec-3c24-a219-8eafc8e96cc9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "мед. омертвление органа вследствие недостатка кровоснабжения"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "34069bd8-32c7-4c45-bb2c-ff72d2ad91de",
                                "sense_id": "32135dfa-87dc-34a7-991e-147f8fa77eca",
                                "text": "Судя по всему, у него обширный инфа́ркт и полное истощение организма."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e553bbc6-b5a2-4401-af43-f5ca81e4f5c8",
                                "sense_id": "32135dfa-87dc-34a7-991e-147f8fa77eca",
                                "text": "«А ведь доведут кого-нибудь до инфа́ркта, ― злорадно подумал Гусев про юмористов из «группы поддержки»."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "028f211d-ba37-4856-8c84-8da2e2458fb5",
                        "source_entry_id": "83b20194-e1ec-3c24-a219-8eafc8e96cc9",
                        "source_sense_id": "32135dfa-87dc-34a7-991e-147f8fa77eca",
                        "target_lang_word": "infarction",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "infarction",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "634a3329-315d-34b1-a2bd-080492197189",
                                        "entry_id": "2c166d39-a24a-3ba1-b60e-d235dc8a03e1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The process which causes an infarct."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae23c66b-a970-394d-92c2-08530eaebbfc",
                                        "entry_id": "2c166d39-a24a-3ba1-b60e-d235dc8a03e1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An infarct (an area of ischemic necrosis)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55e0a783-5f3a-4d51-b0da-0b1eed261129",
                                                "sense_id": "ae23c66b-a970-394d-92c2-08530eaebbfc",
                                                "text": "But we can no longer regard the mere fact of these diffuse condensations of the lung becoming yellow and caseous as an evidence of their tuberculous nature, especially since the pathological anatomists, and among them Virchow, have shown that formations of the most different kind, having not the slightest connection with tubercule— as, for example, old cancerous masses, lymphatic glands swollen by a hyperplasia of cells, hæmorrhagical infarctions, abscesses, &c.— undergo exactly the same caseous transformation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc0e0320-caf2-43ce-b109-df256f140881",
                                                "sense_id": "ae23c66b-a970-394d-92c2-08530eaebbfc",
                                                "text": "Once stroke was classified by a risk factor-free method, the stronger relationship between hypertension and lacunar versus nonlacunar infarction patients disappeared."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d938ed60-ba6c-414b-9810-ee06aa174b6b",
                        "source_entry_id": "83b20194-e1ec-3c24-a219-8eafc8e96cc9",
                        "source_sense_id": "32135dfa-87dc-34a7-991e-147f8fa77eca",
                        "target_lang_word": "heart attack",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "heart attack",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a135b2ce-02a5-3543-ba67-7cd88efc5fba",
                                        "entry_id": "d3af3485-4f8b-3137-9ada-1ba6908493b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An acute myocardial infarction, sometimes fatal, caused by the sudden occurrence of coronary thrombosis, which obstructs the blood supply to the heart and leads to necrosis of heart muscle tissue."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3dbff06-e73f-4ebd-a513-af989cb122bd",
                                                "sense_id": "a135b2ce-02a5-3543-ba67-7cd88efc5fba",
                                                "text": "Before kick-off, a section of Chelsea's support sadly let themselves and their club down by noisily interrupting the silence held in memory of the Hillsborough disaster and for Livorno midfielder Piermario Morosini, who collapsed and died after suffering a heart attack during a Serie B game on Saturday."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "11124095-df97-3f72-9585-c0695e62e5bc",
                                        "entry_id": "d3af3485-4f8b-3137-9ada-1ba6908493b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A major fright."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5482f4be-edc0-4925-91b4-92c2c8b2a45d",
                                                "sense_id": "11124095-df97-3f72-9585-c0695e62e5bc",
                                                "text": "She'll have a heart attack when she sees that!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c52c355d-5639-3923-9cc8-972df2a690e0",
                                        "entry_id": "d3af3485-4f8b-3137-9ada-1ba6908493b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Death or failure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "374a1058-ebe7-4bec-89c3-26ed82de140b",
                                                "sense_id": "c52c355d-5639-3923-9cc8-972df2a690e0",
                                                "text": "My computer had a heart attack when I tried to get it to run that program."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
